          "quote": "In the 40 �T group the overall ANOVA did not show any significant main effect, whereas in the 80 �T group significant main effects of exposure condition ( *F* 1,14 = 11.100, *P* = 0.0049), of sequence ( *F* 1,14 = 19.591, *P* = 0.0006) and of their interaction ( *F* 1,14 = 11.463, *P* = 0.0044) were found. Post hoc comparison in this group revealed that alpha activity after magnetic treatment was significantly ( *P* < 0.05) greater than after sham"
